SUMMARY:The Fall 2026 Gala Spectacular
DESCRIPTION:This spring\, we’ll be back on the Quad for our beloved Super Mega Music Festival. But with November temperatures dropping\, we’re taking our fall celebration downtown to one of Asheville’s most iconic stages: The Orange Peel! \nJoin us Tuesday\, November 17\, for a dazzling\, genre-hopping showcase of UNC Asheville’s musical ensembles. Expect an evening bursting with talent\, creativity\, unexpected musical combinations\, and enough stylistic variety to keep your ears on their toes. \nAnd the timing couldn’t be better! Presented in partnership with Undergraduate Research Day\, the Fall Gala Spectacular is the perfect way to blow off some steam after a full day of presentations\, discoveries\, and intellectual heavy lifting. \nFrom intimate performances to full-ensemble showstoppers\, it’s a chance to experience the extraordinary range of music being made right here on our campus\, all while supporting the next generation of UNC Asheville musicians.
URL:https://www.unca.edu/event/the-fall-2026-gala-spectacular/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.unca.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Event_Calendar_-_TEMPLATE_76.png
END:VEVENT
